* ShadowControl
** For End-Point (e.g. inaccurate reporting, push install/upgrade, Policy Push)
*** Verify that DTX has been Provided
*** Open them and verify that ShadowControl EndPoint Agent is shown as an installed application from the dtx.log located in C:\ProgramData\dtx\logs in the .7z file
** For Appliance (e.g. Install/Upgrade, incomplete/missing reports, server 500)
*** No further data collection required

